{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43406","headline":"石榴 · 无名氏","name":"石榴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉啸秋云槐叶齐，石榴香老庭枝低。\n流霞色染紫罂粟，黄蜡纸苞红瓠犀。\n玉刻冰壶[含]露湿，斒斑似带湘娥泣。\n萧娘初嫁嗜甘酸，嚼破水精千万粒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}